{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48813","headline":"勅移橘栽 · 张彪","name":"勅移橘栽","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南橘北爲枳，古来岂虚言。\n徙植期不变，阴阳感君恩。\n枝条皆宛然，本土封其根。\n及时望栽种，万里绕花园。\n滋味岂圣心，实以忧黎元。\n暂劳致力重，永感贡献烦。\n是嗟草木类，禀异於乾坤。\n愿爲王母桃，千岁奉至尊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张彪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48813.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48813","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}